sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant V as Viewer
    participant W as Worker
    participant K as Kernel
    V->>W: HELLO (protocol, version)
    W-->>V: HELLO
    loop Each diagram
        V->>W: Mermaid text
        W->>K: setrlimit(RLIMIT_CPU)
        alt Within its caps
            W-->>V: SVG
        else Past them
            K-->>W: SIGXCPU
            Note over V,W: The diagram fails, the next starts a new worker
        end
    end
